("v14", "type", "String")
("v14", "scalar", "Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: exceptionally beautiful panoramic website background illustration for Aaron Alderman's personal expedition, titled in HTML 'Inside the mind of a modern-day sourcerer'. Generate the image ONLY, no lettering, no logos, no UI, no typography. An impossible but tactile landscape of thought: a monumental dark stone archway on the right opens onto a luminous distant sea and many branching paths, a quiet observatory carved into cliffs, delicate aged brass orbital instruments suspended like constellations, a small amber lantern at the path's edge, hints of forest and reflection. These are poetic decorative motifs for physics, faith, machines and care, not scientific diagrams. Sophisticated cinematic matte-painting realism with fine stone grain, deep atmospheric distance, subtle celestial dust, extraordinary light. Existing site palette: midnight blue, muted violet, burnished amber, pale gold, a trace of moss green. Restrained, spacious, mysterious and humane, not game concept-art clutter or neon fantasy. No wizard, no hat, no invented portrait. Composition: very wide landscape 16:9; left 45 percent is dark, quiet negative space for a large cream serif headline; the architectural portal and exquisite detail occupy the right half. Strong focal point near right-center, readable when cropped vertically for mobile. Use rich chiaroscuro and a warm horizon instead of oversaturated glow. It should feel like entering an expansive mind, with a world continually opening beyond the first doorway.")
("v13", "value", "v14")
